flowchart LR
  K[智能开局正式发布] --> S[不可变 Fabric Input Snapshot]
  C[CMDB 身份 / 端口 / Cable] --> S
  S --> B[Blueprint Revision / Intent]
  B --> O[Day-0 Onboarding]
  B --> P[Profiles + 能力快照]
  P --> G[逐设备 ConfigBuild]
  O --> V[七层 Preflight]
  G --> V
  V --> X[冻结 ChangeSet / Rollout / Flow Revision]
  X --> A[独立审批]
  A --> J[既有自动作业平台]
  J --> AP[Applied 回执]
  AP --> OB[独立 Observability 回采]
  G --> Q[Desired / Rendered / Applied / Operational]
  OB --> Q
  Q --> N[限定范围 Network Ready]
  N --> T[既有 NetworkTest / NCCL]
  Q --> D[Drift]
  D --> X
  S -.新版本显式采用 / 下游STALE.-> B
